{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And the priest shall wave them, a wave-offering.</b> This teaches that they require waving while alive. One might think all of them — Scripture says, ״upon the two lambs״ (see Menachot 62a)." "<b>Holy they shall be.</b> Since an individual's shelamim are lesser holy-offerings, it was necessary to state regarding communal shelamim that they are kodshei kodashim."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:58.056210884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}